  "title": "AIRO Completes Major Delivery of its RQ-35 ISTAR UAS, Highlighting Production Scale",
  "summary": "MCLEAN, Va.–(BUSINESS WIRE)– AIRO Group Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: AIRO), a next-generation aerospace and defense company, today announced the successful delivery of a major unmanned aircraft systems (UAS) order to a global defense customer. Completed during the second quarter of 2026, the delivery highlights the continued expansion of AIRO’s autonomous systems business. The delivery marks another milestone […]",
